{"2691080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Godreaper", "steam_appid": 2691080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691080/extras/b8dbb20601f919b895c58759694b3fc0.poster.avif?t=1785415767\" width=1170 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691080/extras/b8dbb20601f919b895c58759694b3fc0.webm?t=1785415767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691080/extras/b8dbb20601f919b895c58759694b3fc0.mp4?t=1785415767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Godreaper</strong> is a dark third-person Action-Adventure set in an East Slavic <strong>Dark Fantasy</strong> world. The ancient order collapsed when an unknown corruption struck the roots of the World Tree. A poisonous decay blinded the gods; losing their sanity, the guardians of order turned into mad tyrants. While creatures from Navi feast upon the ruins of villages, a relentless horde advances from the east upon the borders of the motherland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691080/extras/de6cf571d18e2224cea50bb3b5f3448a.avif?t=1785415767\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691080/extras_big/de6cf571d18e2224cea50bb3b5f3448a.webp?t=1785415767 width=1560 height=91 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the boots of a mighty Bogatyr — an ancient Slavic warrior — and enter a world where old legends and grim folktales come to life. Unravel the mysteries of the dying lands, gain the support of peaceful spirits, and overcome maddened, dangerous monsters. Challenge the dire threat looming over your homeland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691080/extras/eb2dc720464a3a9c5ed0f66417e0208b.poster.avif?t=1785415767\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691080/extras/eb2dc720464a3a9c5ed0f66417e0208b.webm?t=1785415767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691080/extras/eb2dc720464a3a9c5ed0f66417e0208b.mp4?t=1785415767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691080/extras/6ef5adba5fc84a4a15ebc225d9f47dd0.avif?t=1785415767\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691080/extras_big/6ef5adba5fc84a4a15ebc225d9f47dd0.webp?t=1785415767 width=1560 height=91 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The power in your hands knows no bounds! Shatter enemy armor layer by layer using your entire arsenal — from shield bashes to levitating weapons that possess their own souls and allow you to control the battlefield from a distance. A variety of accessories, upgrade trees, and stats grant you total freedom. Choose the strategy that will lead you to victory in every battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691080/extras/2e4fa2d46de1209155db1c5f4020dfe0.poster.avif?t=1785415767\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691080/extras/2e4fa2d46de1209155db1c5f4020dfe0.webm?t=1785415767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691080/extras/2e4fa2d46de1209155db1c5f4020dfe0.mp4?t=1785415767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691080/extras/7fc910a4153afc7a3e74395c9a27cf3e.avif?t=1785415767\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691080/extras_big/7fc910a4153afc7a3e74395c9a27cf3e.webp?t=1785415767 width=1560 height=91 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the ancient magic granted to the Bogatyrs by the gods themselves and unleash its power upon hordes of enemies. Use this strength to change the world around you: quell raging fires with frost, pierce the darkness with electrical currents, or burn away Navi's growths with fierce flames. Forge your path where there was once only an abyss to reach the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691080/extras/233ccca890bf60c36b9114d655cfc6b8.poster.avif?t=1785415767\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691080/extras/233ccca890bf60c36b9114d655cfc6b8.webm?t=1785415767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691080/extras/233ccca890bf60c36b9114d655cfc6b8.mp4?t=1785415767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691080/extras/d1a59830b2bbbf2a16e6dabbb2e8b3fe.avif?t=1785415767\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691080/extras_big/d1a59830b2bbbf2a16e6dabbb2e8b3fe.webp?t=1785415767 width=1560 height=91 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious plague has gripped the native lands. Why does it drive even the almighty gods to madness, and why is the Bogatyr Zaremire the only one who can resist the sickness? Discover who poisoned the World Tree and why, find your family, revive the brotherhood of Bogatyrs, and stop the catastrophe before the world finally falls in the face of the inevitable!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691080/extras/69353c9af04a1376a6a1041349ebcc9d.poster.avif?t=1785415767\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691080/extras/69353c9af04a1376a6a1041349ebcc9d.webm?t=1785415767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691080/extras/69353c9af04a1376a6a1041349ebcc9d.mp4?t=1785415767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691080/extras/b8dbb20601f919b895c58759694b3fc0.poster.avif?t=1785415767\" width=1170 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691080/extras/b8dbb20601f919b895c58759694b3fc0.webm?t=1785415767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691080/extras/b8dbb20601f919b895c58759694b3fc0.mp4?t=1785415767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Godreaper</strong> is a dark third-person Action-Adventure set in an East Slavic <strong>Dark Fantasy</strong> world. The ancient order collapsed when an unknown corruption struck the roots of the World Tree. A poisonous decay blinded the gods; losing their sanity, the guardians of order turned into mad tyrants. While creatures from Navi feast upon the ruins of villages, a relentless horde advances from the east upon the borders of the motherland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691080/extras/de6cf571d18e2224cea50bb3b5f3448a.avif?t=1785415767\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691080/extras_big/de6cf571d18e2224cea50bb3b5f3448a.webp?t=1785415767 width=1560 height=91 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the boots of a mighty Bogatyr — an ancient Slavic warrior — and enter a world where old legends and grim folktales come to life. Unravel the mysteries of the dying lands, gain the support of peaceful spirits, and overcome maddened, dangerous monsters. Challenge the dire threat looming over your homeland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691080/extras/eb2dc720464a3a9c5ed0f66417e0208b.poster.avif?t=1785415767\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691080/extras/eb2dc720464a3a9c5ed0f66417e0208b.webm?t=1785415767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691080/extras/eb2dc720464a3a9c5ed0f66417e0208b.mp4?t=1785415767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691080/extras/6ef5adba5fc84a4a15ebc225d9f47dd0.avif?t=1785415767\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co