ch the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691080/extras/233ccca890bf60c36b9114d655cfc6b8.poster.avif?t=1785415767\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691080/extras/233ccca890bf60c36b9114d655cfc6b8.webm?t=1785415767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691080/extras/233ccca890bf60c36b9114d655cfc6b8.mp4?t=1785415767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691080/extras/d1a59830b2bbbf2a16e6dabbb2e8b3fe.avif?t=1785415767\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691080/extras_big/d1a59830b2bbbf2a16e6dabbb2e8b3fe.webp?t=1785415767 width=1560 height=91 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious plague has gripped the native lands. Why does it drive even the almighty gods to madness, and why is the Bogatyr Zaremire the only one who can resist the sickness? Discover who poisoned the World Tree and why, find your family, revive the brotherhood of Bogatyrs, and stop the catastrophe before the world finally falls in the face of the inevitable!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691080/extras/69353c9af04a1376a6a1041349ebcc9d.poster.avif?t=1785415767\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691080/extras/69353c9af04a1376a6a1041349ebcc9d.webm?t=1785415767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691080/extras/69353c9af04a1376a6a1041349ebcc9d.mp4?t=1785415767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Godreaper is a dark third-person action-adventure where the fate of your homeland hangs in the balance. As the bogatyr Zaremire, explore every corner of a world inspired by East Slavic mythology. Defeat the creatures of Navi, battle almighty gods and save your homeland from inevitable destruction.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Korean<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691080/a445207533666e19cb148b865e18486554e5169d/header.jpg?t=1785415767", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691080/4b226f877cd9c28cb2df8dd0d3cf619d7e0bf83e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785415767", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691080/4b226f877cd9c28cb2df8dd0d3cf619d7e0bf83e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785415767", "website": "https://next-genium.com/ru/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-10400 / AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2060 / AMD Radeon RX 6600 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 60 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Windows Compatible Audio Device<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD Required. Tested with DLSS enabled on NVIDIA GPUs, FSR on AMD GPUs. Targets 1080p at 60 FPS on High quality settings.</li></ul